.TH CBMAP_ELEM_COUNT 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Functions"
.SH NAME
cbmap_elem_count \- get the number of elements in the map
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ccollections/cbstmap.h>

size_t cbmap_elem_count(cbmap cbm);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Returns the number of key-value pairs that the BST map stores now.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
cbm  BST map to query
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
Returns the number of elements in the map
.fi
.SH NOTES
.nf
O(1) complexity
The function asserts if cbm is NULL
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR cbmap_insert_elem (3),
.BR cbmap_delete_elem (3)
